# Android Phone Deploy Rule

When deploying this app to my phone, always update the installed app with the newest build.

- Do not stop at "run only" behavior.
- Prefer install-first deployment so the device has the latest APK installed.
- Use `flutter install` for phone deployment.
- If needed, build first, then install the resulting APK.

Preferred commands:

```bash
~/flutter/bin/flutter pub get
~/flutter/bin/flutter build apk --debug
~/flutter/bin/flutter install
```

If app launch is requested separately, run it after install.
